-p0070","role":"不从达言、破走还成都","evidence":["liuliao-q-22512f040a2aea93d481"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0064","role":"叛封、魏兴太守封郧乡侯屯洵口","evidence":["liuliao-q-22512f040a2aea93d481"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0073","role":"降魏、魏假耽怀集将军徙居南阳","evidence":["liuliao-q-22512f040a2aea93d481"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuliao-q-22512f040a2aea93d481"]},"ordering_evidence":"liuliao-q-22512f040a2aea93d481","source_order":[40,12,0],"order":7247},{"id":"liuliao-e-r021","title":"魏略记黄初申仪复来拜魏兴太守封列侯","accounts":[{"id":"liuliao-a-a627998ee9a4f6425855","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"魏略记黄初申仪复来拜魏兴太守封列侯","evidence":["liuliao-q-9bd6da51f3aaed524153"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0064","role":"复来，拜魏兴太守封列侯","evidence":["liuliao-q-9bd6da51f3aaed524153"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuliao-q-9bd6da51f3aaed524153"]},"ordering_evidence":"liuliao-q-9bd6da51f3aaed524153","source_order":[40,79,86],"order":7252},{"id":"liuliao-e-o069","title":"魏略记申仪言孟达贰心及反时断蜀道","accounts":[{"id":"liuliao-a-0ad9ad92823b383f813c","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"魏略记申仪言孟达贰心及反时断蜀道","evidence":["liuliao-q-06961e1ef68f41a28da9"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0064","role":"数上言达有贰心，反时绝蜀道","evidence":["liuliao-q-06961e1ef68f41a28da9"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0071","role":"被上言贰心，后反","evidence":["liuliao-q-06961e1ef68f41a28da9"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuliao-q-06961e1ef68f41a28da9"]},"ordering_evidence":"liuliao-q-06961e1ef68f41a28da9","source_order":[40,79,116],"order":7253},{"id":"liuliao-e-r022","title":"魏略记申仪诣宛见司马懿后入朝拜楼船将军","accounts":[{"id":"liuliao-a-2198f49663d0068a572f","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"魏略记申仪诣宛见司马懿后入朝拜楼船将军","evidence":["liuliao-q-6b7e94a7014be6b47809"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0064","role":"诣宛见司马宣王，入朝拜楼船将军","evidence":["liuliao-q-6b7e94a7014be6b47809"]},{"person":"wudi-p0364","role":"劝仪来朝","evidence":["liuliao-q-6b7e94a7014be6b47809"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuliao-q-6b7e94a7014be6b47809"]},"ordering_evidence":"liuliao-q-6b7e94a7014be6b47809","source_order":[40,79,151],"order":7254}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0064","name":"申仪","evidence":["mingdi-q-p007","liuliao-q-79ddd8e23b5a267e775e","liuliao-q-22512f040a2aea93d481","liuliao-q-06961e1ef68f41a28da9","liuliao-q-9bd6da51f3aaed524153","liuliao-q-6b7e94a7014be6b47809"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"mingdi-m-p007-mingdi-p0064","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["mingdi-q-p007"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liuliao-q-06961e1ef68f41a28da9","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-c6646f0ee12ee8a93736","layer":"pei","quote":"太和中，仪与孟达不和，数上言达有贰心于蜀。及达反，仪绝蜀道，使救不到。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ccf0b2ee090d7b0f0d83","start":116,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-22512f040a2aea93d481","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-bb5e55dfbb21fd6de43d","layer":"original","quote":"封不从达言。申仪叛封，封破走还成都。申耽降魏，魏假耽怀集将军〖56〗，徙居南阳；仪魏兴太守〖57〗，封（真）〔郧〕乡侯，屯洵口","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":11,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-6b7e94a7014be6b47809","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-c6646f0ee12ee8a93736","layer":"pei","quote":"达死后，仪诣宛，见司马宣王。宣王劝使来朝，仪至京师，诏转拜仪楼船将军，在礼请中。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ccf0b2ee090d7b0f0d83","start":151,"end":191,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-79ddd8e23b5a267e775e","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-ee57665e94513ca12cf7","layer":"original","quote":"达将进攻上庸〖4〗，先主阴恐达难独任；乃遣封自汉中乘沔水下统达军，与达会上庸。上庸太守申耽举众降，遣妻子及宗族诣成都。先主加耽征北将军，领上庸太守，员乡侯如故。以耽弟仪为建信将军、西城太守〖5〗。迁封为副军将军","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":31,"end":136,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-9bd6da51f3aaed524153","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-c6646f0ee12ee8a93736","layer":"pei","quote":"黄初中，仪复来还。诏即以兄故号，加仪；因拜魏兴太守，封列侯。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ccf0b2ee090d7b0f0d83","start":86,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-p007e-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5bf81d9dfe407ed70c63","layer":"pei","quote":"魏兴太守申仪与达有隙，密表达与蜀潜通，帝未之信也。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-680a01f5d7c24c678bdc","start":575,"end":600,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-p007","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5bf81d9dfe407ed70c63","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏略》曰：“达以延康元年率部曲四千余家，归魏。文帝时初即王位，既宿知有达，闻其来，甚悦。令贵臣有识察者往观之，还曰‘将帅之才也’，或曰‘卿相之器也’；王益钦达，逆与达书曰：‘近日有命，未足达旨。何者？昔伊挚背商而归周，百里去虞而入秦，乐毅感鸱夷以蝉蜕，王遵识逆顺以去就；皆审兴废之符效，知成败之必然；故丹青画其形容，良史载其功勋。闻卿姿度纯茂，器量优绝，当骋能明时，收名传记；今者翻然濯鳞清流，甚相嘉乐。虚心西望，依依若旧；下笔属辞，欢心从之。昔虞卿入赵，再见取相；陈平就汉，一觐参乘。孤今于卿，情过于往；故致所御马物，以昭忠爱。’又曰：‘今者海内清定，万里一统；三垂无边尘之警，中夏无狗吠之虞；以是弛网阔禁，与世无疑；保官空虚，初无（资）〔质〕任。卿来相就，当明孤意；慎勿令家人缤纷道路，以亲骇疏也。若卿欲来相见，且当先安部曲，有所保固；然后徐徐轻骑来东。’达既至谯，进见闲雅，才辩过人，众莫不属目。又王近出，乘小辇，执达手，抚其背戏之曰：‘卿得无为刘备刺客邪？’遂与同载。又加拜散骑常侍，领新城太守，委以西南之任。时众臣或以为待之太猥，又不宜委以方任。王闻之曰：‘吾保其无他，亦譬以蒿箭射蒿中耳。’达既为文帝所宠，又与桓阶、夏侯尚亲善。及文帝崩，时（桓）〔阶〕、尚皆卒，达自以羁旅久在疆埸，心不自安。诸葛亮闻之，阴欲诱达，数书招之；达与相报答。魏兴太守申仪与达有隙，密表达与蜀潜通，帝未之信也。司马宣王遣参军梁几，察之，又劝其入朝。达惊惧，遂反。”","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-680a01f5d7c24c678bdc","start":0,"end":627,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o049c-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-8a052498f4fbd858ba0b","layer":"original","quote":"遣刘封、孟达、李平等攻申耽于上庸〖15〗。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":83,"end":104,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-c3e56caa3865de7f7114","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-c3e56caa3865de7f7114","layer":"modern","quote":"〖11〗二十四年：建安二十四年（公元 219）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":222,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fd85f82251e498647de7","start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o048","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-2d515ba2dae40f6a248e","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年春〖11〗，自阳平南渡沔水，缘山稍前〖12〗，于定军山（势）作营〖13〗。渊将兵来争其地，先主命黄忠乘高鼓噪攻之。大破渊军，斩渊及曹公所署益州刺史赵颙等。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":203,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
